  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "same_t",
   "x": 104,
   "y": 748,
   "width": 1076,
   "height": 75.0,
   "text": "The same shape at every level\nA tool, a step and the pipeline each open their own activity, record their own metrics and send their\nown events. The LLM call adds one more span, LLM.Invoke, with the llm.* metrics. Spans nest through\nActivity.Current (Pipeline > Step > LLM.Invoke > Tool), so nothing has to arrange the tree.",
   "originalText": "The same shape at every level\nA tool, a step and the pipeline each open their own activity, record their own metrics and send their\nown events. The LLM call adds one more span, LLM.Invoke, with the llm.* metrics. Spans nest through\nActivity.Current (Pipeline > Step > LLM.Invoke > Tool), so nothing has to arrange the tree.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 230053,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 230054,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "type": "rectangle",
   "id": "flags",
   "x": 1320,
   "y": 730,
   "width": 1020,
   "height": 150,
   "strokeColor": "#dc2626",
