   "x": 1344,
   "y": 748,
   "width": 976,
   "height": 114,
   "text": "EnableTracing and EnableMetrics do nothing\nBoth are bound from AITaskAgent:Observability and both are ignored: the framework always\nopens its activities and always records its metrics. What decides whether any of it is collected\nis whether you registered the source and the meter with the SDK.",
